OL,3,GNEWSAWoman reveals how she found her
OL,4,A'tribe' years after baby son's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly half a century on and the pain
OL,7,Fis still evident when Julie Hill talks
OL,8,Fabout her baby son.
OL,10,FAs a 19-year-old, she gave birth to
OL,11,FMartin. At 32 weeks, he was premature
OL,12,Fand lived for just two days.
OL,14,FJulie never got to hold Martin - and
OL,15,Ffor decades never even knew where he
OL,16,Fwas buried.
OL,18,FShe does now, but talking about that
OL,19,Ftime in her life still brings tears to
OL,20,Fher eyes.
